# Micro-commit convention (see CONTRIBUTING.md)
# <type>(<scope>): <what changed, in plain english, <= 72 chars>
#
# Examples:
#   feat(core): add MOQ guard to order proposal sizing
#   docs(spec): define OTIF formula and owner in KPI catalog
#   fix(engine): correct shelf-life cap floor in cover calc
#   test(core): golden cases for rate invalidation
#   chore: add .gitignore and editor config
#
# One logical change per commit. Say what was written, deleted or improved.
